// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P4104998478" "See, Amanda, the key to this scenario is to know when to grab a good story!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2772738764" "And {HeroName}, there's a good story here! You've got yourself a reporter, let's get going!"
