"P2469952496" "<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.5 d=8><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>John Houston here folks, bringing LIVE to you {HeroName}'s destruction of Brickstown!<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.5 d=8><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Now, the key here for {HeroName} is to show {Hero.gender=male his|her} strength against the authorities.<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.5 d=8><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>{Hero.gender=male He|She} is going to want to make sure to take out a ton of the PPD, Paragon Police Department for you folks at home."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P2969376128" "<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.5 d=8><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Folks, as you can see, {HeroName} has the loot from the bank. Classic bank robbery!<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.5 d=8><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>If I'm correct, some of the New Praetorians will show up at any moment!<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.5 d=8><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Those heroes better watch out! {HeroName} could take down ANY of the heroes who try to get in {Hero.gender=male his|her} way!"
