// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2908836578" "Can we trust them? The New Praetorians?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1970988149" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Parson and Pendragon are OK. I'm not too sure about the others."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Name 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2159377844" "I can't believe this. How did Marauder of all people get allowed to walk free?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1080592516" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>He's not free. We have orders to take him down if anyone even thinks he's doing something wrong."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Name 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2144708450" "<t=5 d=5>I don't like it. That woman used to be Mother Mayhem, how can we trust her?<t=5 d=5>I did, I just don't buy it. The Praetorians are all around us now, I don't like it."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P83055771" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>It wasn't her, her body was being used by Shalice Tilman. Didn't you read the report?"

