// Objective - Name 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1553125323" "Did you see? That guy Riptide, the one who attacked Talos, he's free too!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3017824441" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>He's a good soldier, from what I heard. He was just fighting for the wrong side."

