// Script Variable Caption :
"P2968616454" "<t=7 caption x=0.3 y=0.5 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor ForestGreen>This is Vernon von Grun! Hello, {HeroName}! I have sent you some BEES! Nya-ha-ha-ha!<t=7 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor ForestGreen>I haven't forgotten all the help you've given me, now it is time for me to help you!"
// Script Variable Caption :
"P3786479350" "<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>John Houston here folks, and boy, do we have a show for you today!<t=5 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>It's {HeroName} against the Carnival of Shadows! Does it get ANY better? I don't think so!<t=5 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>The key here is that {HeroName} DOESN'T want one of those masks put on {Hero.gender=male his|her} face!<t=5 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>I know I'm excited to see what plans {HeroName} has in store for the Carnival! Let's stay tuned!"
// Script Variable Caption :
"P3827148097" "<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>It looks like... oh my gosh! This is EXCITING folks!<t=5 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>The Carnival has made a SHADOW DOPPELGANGER of {HeroName}!<t=5 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>It's {HeroName} vs. {HeroName}! Who will win?!"
