// Objective - DeanMacArthur 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1838612346" "You rescued Dean MacArthur!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P510810908" "You've sent a very direct message to the Carnival of Shadows!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2217260396" "That was quite interesting, sending a Shadow Doppelganger after you, {HeroName}, quite interesting; I suppose everyone wants to get into cloning these days.<br><br>The people of the Rogue Isles can't stop talking about your work, {HeroName}. In fact, as far as we can tell, that attack on the Carnival's base has caused a lot of people to rethink their attack on you.<br><br>Splice intercepted a communication between the Sky Raiders indicating that they called off an attack on you. She also sent a virus into the computers of the Rogue Arachnos. They won't be bothering us for the moment. However, we still have one group left that seems focused on trying to take you down."
// RandomFameString :
"P816139774" "I watched {HeroName} fight {Hero.gender=male himself|herself}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1395020851" "<color yellow>The Family</color> is your next target. Bobcat found out that they've hired a hero hunter to fight you. The man goes by the name of <color yellow>Crimson Revenant</color>. They say he's the best at taking down heroes; I suppose the Family wants to test him against you.<br><br>Now, I should warn you, the Family isn't in this for the money. They're trying to prove a point. You're becoming a big name here in St. Martial, but they believe that this place is <i>their</i> territory."
// AcceptString :
"P3831322600" "I'll show them who St. Martial belongs to."
// SendOffString :
"P2565678882" "What are your plans to show them who the city belongs to?<br><br><color orange>You decide that after taking care of Crimson Revenant, you'll go to the main city block that the Family owns here and create complete <i>chaos</i>, wrecking everything they own and leaving your mark on them! You explain the plan to Mr. G, who nods.</color><br><br>Excellent plan, {HeroName}. Splice has just received word that Crimson Revenant is waiting for you on an old highway in St. Martial. It was a rather... cheery message, very cheery. We'll be keeping the Vanguard helicopter reserved for our long distance flights, as usual. Good luck, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1129497693" "Send the Family a message"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1383974711" "I'm sure you'll handle this with ease, {HeroName}."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1132086944" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: All in the Family</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3712046291" "You arrive at the spot where Crimson Revenant said he would be waiting for you."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - OnEnterObjectiveComplete 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - SetObjectiveText 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - LuaMission 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable Caption :
"P2821445370" "<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>What a fight we have today, folks! Could this be the end for {HeroName}?<t=5 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Crimson Revenant is a real professional, the key here is that {HeroName} needs to NOT get killed!"
// Script Variable Caption :
"P791877164" "<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>What a twist folks! {HeroName} has gotten Crimson Revenant to be an ally!<t=5 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Let's see what the two of them can do against the forces of the Family!"
// Script Variable Caption :
"P1160974178" "<t=7 caption x=0.3 y=0.5 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Folks, I'm proud to broadcast the following to you.<t=7 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>See, {HeroName} is out to humiliate the Family on their own turf. Classic villain move, if I say so!<t=7 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>The key here is angering the Family. Beating them down isn't enough!<t=7 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>If I know {HeroName}, {Hero.gender=male he|she} is going to destroy all of the Family's cars, too!<t=7 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>That's going to make them REALLY angry, that's the set up, you see!<t=7 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>It's going to make their defeat by {HeroName} hurt even MORE! I'm excited!"
// Script Variable Caption :
"P4193520926" "<t=7 caption x=0.7 y=0.5 d=7><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Coral>Folks, I'm proud to broadcast the following to you.<t=7 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=7><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Coral>This is Splice. I've found the Yin family.<t=7 caption x=0.7 y=0.5 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>They're in St. Martial, of course. I'll get you more details when you're done with the Family."
