"P2954629659" "<t=5 d=5>Hrmph, thank you, {HeroName}, you're a true friend. These fiends cornered me in Sharkhead and dragged me here!<t=5 d=5>You've once against proved that you're better than the rest by saving me. I am still in your debt, it seems."
// Script Variable RescueObjectiveText :
"P740744762" "Rescue Vincent Ross"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P56216601" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Shut it, freak. We're gonna get a high price on your head from {HeroName}."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2084502606" "We ain't ready yet, just bust {HeroName}'s face in!"

