// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P31334946" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>We help Yin and he continues gettin' us that Praetorian technology."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2161655812" "I gotta say, seein' that Praetorian stuff in action is really somethin' else."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2420201514" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Tell me about it. You hear about Fixadine?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4133894058" "Can't believe {HeroName} is getting' this far!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2933706445" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>I can believe it, shouldn't underestimate that kinda {Hero.gender=male guy|girl}."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P23816933" "I keep tellin' ya, the money is in Port Oakes! We can run that town now, if we wanted to."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1525327837" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Give it time, we got a ton of stuff to do first."
