"P38257172" "Tub Ci"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3253797952" "This must end today. {HeroName} is too dangerous to the world."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2150822610" "This is where it ends, {HeroName}!"
